  "notes": "A formal administrative term used when an official body provides documents, licenses, or funds to individuals or organizations. The subject is typically a government office or institution.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {証明書|しょうめいしょ}を{交付|こうふ}する: to issue a certificate\n- {免許|めんきょ}を{交付|こうふ}する: to issue a license\n- {補助金|ほじょきん}を{交付|こうふ}する: to grant a subsidy\n- {交付|こうふ}{金|きん}: grant money, subsidy\n- {交付|こうふ}{日|び}: date of issue\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {発行|はっこう}する: to issue, to publish — broader; used for passports, books, tickets, cards\n- {支給|しきゅう}する: to provide, to supply — used for salaries, allowances, equipment\n- {給付|きゅうふ}する: to provide benefits — used for insurance payments, welfare benefits",
